        "valueString": "Well nourished and well developed; mildly anxious; no acute distress. Head atraumatic with no scalp tenderness. Neck full range of motion with no cervical spine tenderness. Alert and oriented to person, place and time; speech coherent; cranial nerves II–XII grossly intact; power 5/5 in upper and lower limbs; normal tone; sensation to light touch intact; finger-nose-finger and heel-shin coordination normal; gait including tandem gait normal; Romberg negative. No focal neurological deficit."
